implementationPlan.description:
SPLIT PART 3 — THE REPLAY MODULE AND THE PURE BUILDER (DoD 3, taskRail 1). Create apps/daemon/src/identity/session-authority-replay-marker.ts and its one-line LF bridge.

MOVE verbatim: :70-80 (ReplayObservation, ReplayMarker), REPLAYED/UNKNOWN_REPLAY from :86-87, :105-107 (replayAggregateId), :354-394 (observeReplayMarker).

ADD the pure producer, which taskRail 1 makes the SINGLE source of SessionAuthorityReplayObserved bytes:

```ts
export interface ReplayMarkerDecisionPlan {
  readonly commandId: string;
  readonly commandKind: "OBSERVE_REPLAY";
  readonly correlationId: string;
  readonly leg: ExpectedVersionDecisionLeg;
  readonly requestFacts: Readonly<Record<string, unknown>>;
  readonly resultFacts: Readonly<Record<string, unknown>>;
}
export function buildReplayMarkerDecisionLeg(
  marker: ReplayMarker,
): ReplayMarkerDecisionPlan | null
```

- Returns null when `!isSessionDigest(marker.replayDigest)`, TAKING NO STORE ARGUMENT AT ALL — that is what makes "no store call" provable rather than asserted.
- Otherwise returns exactly ONE leg: `{aggregateId: replayAggregateId(digest), expectedVersion: 0, events: [{domainSchemaVersion: SESSION_AUTHORITY_SCHEMA_VERSION, eventId: `${commandId}/SessionAuthorityReplayObserved`, eventType: "SessionAuthorityReplayObserved", payload: jsonBytes({replayDigest})}]}`. Every literal — commandId, correlationId, eventId composition, payload, requestFacts, resultFacts — is COPIED from :364-375, not re-derived: DoD 2 forbids any change to vocabulary, aggregate id, event id, payload, decision key or result bytes.
- Freeze the returned plan.

REWRITE observeReplayMarker to consume it: build the plan; null -> UNKNOWN_REPLAY without touching the store; otherwise call commitAuthorityDecisionLegs with `[plan.leg]`. The outcome handling at :377-393 (EXPECTED_VERSION_CONFLICT -> REPLAYED, disposition REPLAYED -> REPLAYED, the previousVersion 0 / currentVersion 1 check, the eventId-undefined check, the frozen ReplayReceipt) moves ACROSS UNCHANGED. Its return type and every consumer-visible discriminant stay identical. Budget ~120 lines.
